        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:1148.822265625,1709.6961669921875,7250.7861328125,4546.8790283203125",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto (Document 1)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Let it be registered in the land tax office and the (departments) attached to it,</li>\n<li>and where similar documents are registered, if God wills.</li>\n<li>It has been registered. Praise be to God for his bounties.</li>\n<li>In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li>\u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan M\u0101jid ibn Ya\u02bfq\u016bb, the broker, may God support him, shall deliver&nbsp;from the total of the dues that</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">he received from Wasly ibn Maym\u016bn what was purchased from his tax-farm, Minyat Maym\u016bn, for the solar year</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">four-hundred and twenty-one, which passed to B\u016b Qal\u0101 \u02bfAbd al-Ra\u1e25m\u0101n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Zakariy\u0101\u02be ibn Muk\u0331t\u0101r, when two nights remained of &Scaron;awwal, in the year&nbsp;four-hundred and twenty-three,&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">to \u02bfAl\u016bn ibn \u1e24an\u016bn, the clerk, and \u1e62ayfi ibn R\u0101&scaron;id and Qolte ibn al-Sarr\u012b, the two surveyors,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">this being written by Musabbi\u1e25\u012b \u02beAb\u016b al-Q\u0101sim al-\u1e24asan ibn al-\u1e24usayn, a noble&nbsp;accountant. He, may God support him, shall pay it&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">to the office through their agency, by his delivering (it) to them, so that he may&nbsp; dispose of the seed-advance.. [&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ]&nbsp;cultivation, in the year four-hundred and twenty-two</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;] ninety-two [&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;]</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
