        },
        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:8744.6533203125,1459.811767578125,3302.2900390625,4871.427001953125",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto (Document 2)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li>The slave of our master, the blessings of God [be upon him ] states:</li>\n<li>that I rceived from\u00a0M\u0101jid ibn Ya\u02bfq\u016bb [\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">from the total of my monthly dues, for the year four-hundred and twenty-three [\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">The receipt of six-hundred and twenty-three. The receipt of [ ] and ten</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and I released him from that, with a quittance of full receipt. This was written on\u00a0 his behalf, by his instruction, and it was registered [\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">in the first ten days of \u1e0eu al-\u1e24ijja, of the year four-hundred and twenty three.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Praise be to God and his blessings be upon his prophet Mu\u1e25ammad and his family [and save them.]\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Our sufficiency is God. What a fine keeper is he! </li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
